OL,3,GNEWSADog fouling and abuse at cemetery
OL,4,A'deeply upsetting'
OL,5,
OL,6,FVisitors to a cemetery are being told
OL,7,Fto show respect and consideration,
OL,8,Ffollowing complaints of abuse,
OL,9,Fthreatening behaviour and dogs
OL,10,Furinating and fouling on memorials.
OL,12,FGloucester City Council said there had
OL,13,Fbeen a significant increase in
OL,14,Fcomplaints from families visiting the
OL,15,Fgraves of loved ones at Gloucester Old
OL,16,FCemetery, also known as Tredworth Road
OL,17,FCemetery.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,348,340,200,160,0,100
